, "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "format": "dash-960091016483963v - 1916x1078 (DASH video)"}, {"url": "https://instagram.ffab1-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQPoXRBUV6lHL06KOrYVXjVaYLAAbH2LJK4GpPdOlfUiXOtKzIO4BJ79wWdQK0cqT-9DigfH7luoIJTK3ldGs6t221q9GbkKdFUBvUc.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=Adr1M1xxfynMO9bV1hcNqgsKcP7yu08zUP8sJMTAYdlibr5XDxjRrrGL3FS7eu1OUHvNaNcHqHKRx_7nGozbGAoo&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=instagram.ffab1-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=vEfMhMELrFcQ7kNvwG_chez&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuMTI3Ni5kYXNoX2Jhc2VsaW5lXzFfdjEiLCJ4cHZfYXNzZXRfaWQiOjE4MTA0MDA0OTYxOTM0MTc4LCJhc3NldF9hZ2VfZGF5cyI6MzksInZpX3VzZWNhc2VfaWQiOjEwMDk5LCJkdXJhdGlvbl9zIjoxNzksInVybGdlbl9zb3VyY2UiOiJ3d3cifQ%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=fac9b02396109e50&_nc_-oQBUCKAJDMywXQGZpT987ZFoYEmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MREAdf4HZeadAQA&_nc_gid=AG2yuzhv8W7hpwyYfE2jMA&_nc_zt=28&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_Af7EfWuw0vD8Cfq_6aT2BkNPRiNlCzvKB5Aiv2cEvE7lFg&oe=6A0D15CB", "width": 1080, "height": 1920, "protocol": "https", "ext": "mp4", "video_ext": "mp4", "audio_ext": "none", "resolution": "1080x1920", "dynamic_range": "SDR", "aspect_ratio": 0.56, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/139.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "format_id": "9", "format": "9 - 1080x1920"}], "title": "Video by calderdune", "description": "A Meditation on Men.\n\nDune and Oppenheimer are films that mean a ton to me, and this was an exercise in filtering my thoughts through the powerful themes present in them. Paul and Robert are two men who are extremely complex, and who are burdened with a path that leads to great power, and destruction. \n\nThis is not an opinion on all men, but those who end up in the magnetic field of power. \n\n🎵: fading light by friendly to crows & LochHaven\n\n#dune #oppenheimer #movies #denisvilleneuve #christophernolan", "duration": 179.291, "timestamp": 1775757017, "uploader_id": "27917430177", "uploader": "Kyle | CalderDune", "channel": "calderdune", "like_count": 11030, "comment_count": 145, "comments": [{"author": "overgrown_gardengnome", "author_id": "20360571", "id": "17945324631188657", "text": "Dude, I recommend studying some dialectical and historical materialism. Individuals don’t cause enormous social transformation, but they are the subjective factor that can (when organized and prepared and placed effectively) influence the way in which those upheavals influence the unfolding of the future. \n\nI’ve always felt that Paul’s prescience in Dune reflects a hyper developed application of dialectical and historical materialism.", "timestamp": 1779072196}, {"author": "saint_of_pablo", "author_id": "29539501436", "id": "18052975085746344", "text": "I cried. This was so beautiful ❤️", "timestamp": 1778959910}, {"author": "lambmalkovich", "author_id": "35192154688", "id": "18458296084129536", "text": "whoa🔥🔥🔥🔥 good work sir", "timestamp": 1778884518}, {"author": "therealjoshthom", "author_id": "158369", "id": "18136898431532274", "text": "Man, your capacity for abstract but so incredibly on point insight into thematic elements of major media, and your ability to present it so beautifully, is so admirable. Keep doing your thing", "timestamp": 1778802977}, {"author": "devanshnaman", "author_id": "7089886348", "id": "17887886871481724", "text": "Wow", "timestamp": 1778358950}, {"author": "mehiarss1991", "author_id": "72056227491", "id": "18081422846393726", "text": "In a sad way, oppenheimer reduced the number of wars in the modern world, because everyone fears starting a war with a nuclear power, sad but kinda true! Without nukes WW3 would've already happened", "timestamp": 1778224778}, {"author": "harshit.ydav", "author_id": "11108783269", "id": "18093617056925817", "text": "Instagram premium pro Max", "timestamp": 1777989999}, {"author": "vrinchaw", "author_id": "45802663664", "id": "18078195005631831", "text": "BRAVO 👏", "timestamp": 1777725550}, {"author": "amos.yndl", "author_id": "50274877949", "id": "17934452247227309", "text": "", "timestamp": 1777412715}], "thumbnails": [{"url": "https://instagram.ffab1-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/662384875_18104005144934178_6797989453796467353_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_p640x640_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6ImltYWdlX3VybGdlbi44MTAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuYzIifQ&_nc_ht=instagram.ffab1-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gGUT4Pw-yFo4jkPKLaQyNU9xjgwQRcSREjyXKU_-KI-vmXHkNv9K6nx4VWjdhgdMm9aUmXBFukM1sTTvh9Rb4Y_&_nc_ohc=ENX2siAKT7sQ7kNvwE67pAH&_nc_gid=AG2yuzhv8W7hpwyYfE2jMA&edm=ANTKIIoBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_Af7iIp8QeHBwZ_ppX_G0lQgEpWXbtW6pLFc64owL3KHFjg&oe=6A1121BA&_nc_sid=d885a2", "width": 640, "height": 1137, "id": "0", "resolution": "640x1137"}, {"url": "https://instagram.ffab1-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/662384875_18104005144934178_6797989453796467353_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_p750x750_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6ImltYWdlX3VybGdlbi44MTAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuYzIifQ&_nc_ht=instagram.ffab1-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gGUT4Pw-yFo4jkPKLaQyNU9xjgwQRcSREjyXKU_-KI-vmXHkNv9K6nx4VWjdhgdMm9aUmXBFukM1sTTvh9Rb4Y_&_nc_ohc=ENX2siAKT7sQ7kNvwE67pAH&_nc_gid=AG2yuzhv8W7hpwyYfE2jMA&edm=ANTKIIoBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_Af6B95shEev3KlVkOnC6EtctdxEd_N6mFWHEIw-JRCBguA&oe=6A1121BA&_nc_sid=d885a2", "width": 750, "height": 1333, "id": "1", "resolution": "750x1333"}, {"url": "https://instagram.ffab1-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/662384875_18104005144934178_6797989453796467353_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6ImltYWdlX3VybGdlbi44MTAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuYzIifQ&_nc_ht=instagram.ffab1-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gGUT4Pw-yFo4jkPKLaQyNU9xjgwQRcSREjyXKU_-KI-vmXHkNv9K6nx4VWjdhgdMm9aUmXBFukM1sTTvh9Rb4Y_&_nc_ohc=ENX2siAKT7sQ7kNvwE67pAH&_nc_gid=AG2yuzhv8W7hpwyYfE2jMA&edm=ANTK